[{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0090","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0090.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-50116","title":"Linux Kernel TTY N_GSM 传出数据路径死锁与链接饥饿漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 n_gsm 驱动（GSM 0710 终端多路复用器）在传出数据路径中存在自旋锁死锁与链路饥饿漏洞（CWE-667）。当线路规程（ldisc）发生拥塞时，上层控制包和数据包的发送处理在同一代码路径中耦合执行，导致自旋锁递归占用和死锁，同时数据通道的高负载会使控制通道因得不到调度而超时断链。本地攻击者可通过向 GSM TTY 设备写入大量数据触发此条件，造成系统拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核 5.18-rc2 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-50116"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-06-18T11:15:41Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:22:47Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 5.19 或更高版本，该版本包含对 n_gsm 驱动中传出数据路径死锁与链路饥饿问题的修复。若无法立即升级，可在不需要 GSM 0710 多路复用功能的系统上禁用 n_gsm 模块（通过 blacklist n_gsm），并避免在串口设备上启用 GSMTTY 线路规程作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/0af021678d5d30c31f5a6b631f404ead3575212a","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/5020173e7e7725110a8d4be1359bf1dfc4b1814d","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/7962a4b900099cf90e02859bb297f2c618d8d940","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c165698c9919b000bdbe73859d3bb7b33bdb9223","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2022/50xxx/CVE-2022-50116.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-50116","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-50116.yaml","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2022-50116.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/99462b1672511a2817705398570cd388f155e617/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-50116.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2022-50116.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/36ddac9224d3973c64320c39be98ecc1f1ca5395/advisories/unreviewed/2025/06/GHSA-gf27-p5cc-4mq4/GHSA-gf27-p5cc-4mq4.json","https://github.com/GingaShift/Anssi-Vulnerability-Intelligence/blob/5e1cffb341ca5a500e965d4cda39bf8603e2ff16/data/offline_prof/first/CVE-2022-50116","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/f446e11135d45cb1643208c82d3c441bd9ae1832/osv/AZL-70409.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/935010a28fdab6bbd2dc347ebc953db9773080d4/usn/8576-1.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0090.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0089","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0089.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-50073","title":"Linux Kernel TAP 驱动空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 tap 驱动中存在空指针解引用漏洞。在 tap_get_user 函数中，调用 virtio_net_hdr_to_skb 时 skb->dev 尚未赋值（该字段在调用后才设置），而该函数内部会调用 dev_parse_header_protocol 访问 skb->dev 指针，从而触发空指针解引用导致内核崩溃。攻击者可通过向受影响系统发送特制的网络数据包触发此漏洞，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-50073"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-06-18T11:15:36Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:22:42Z","remediation":"立即升级 Linux 内核至 5.10.258、5.15.209 或 6.0 及以上版本，各长期支持分支均已包含该补丁。若无法升级，可手动合入补丁 4f61f133f354（将 drivers/net/tap.c 中 skb->dev 赋值移至 virtio_net_hdr_to_skb 调用前）并重新编译内核模块。作为临时缓解措施，可禁用 tap 模块（modprobe -r tap）或停止使用依赖 tap 的虚拟网络设备（如 qemu/kvm 的 virtio-net 后端）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/447ba770cfe798925f4923548b367fd49f0ee5f0","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/4f61f133f354853bc394ec7d6028adb9b02dd701","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/8f90163f9e013c8fc791aab338aab44a46044cfc","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/dd29648fcf69339713f2d25f7014ae905dcdfc18","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2022/50xxx/CVE-2022-50073.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-50073.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-50073","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2022-50073.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/99462b1672511a2817705398570cd388f155e617/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-50073.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/36ddac9224d3973c64320c39be98ecc1f1ca5395/advisories/unreviewed/2025/06/GHSA-j9xf-8j9q-6cvr/GHSA-j9xf-8j9q-6cvr.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2022-50073.html","https://github.com/GingaShift/Anssi-Vulnerability-Intelligence/blob/5e1cffb341ca5a500e965d4cda39bf8603e2ff16/data/offline_prof/first/CVE-2022-50073","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/935010a28fdab6bbd2dc347ebc953db9773080d4/usn/8576-1.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2022/CVE-2022-50073.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0089.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0088","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0088.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-50071","title":"Linux 内核 MPTCP 子流套接字内存泄漏漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 MPTCP 协议实现中存在内存泄漏漏洞，当 mptcp 套接字创建因 CGROUP_INET_SOCK_CREATE eBPF 程序执行失败时，子流（subflow）清理函数 __mptcp_destroy_sock() 未被正确调用，导致所有子流套接字发生泄漏。本地攻击者可利用此漏洞消耗系统内存资源，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核多个版本，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2022-50071"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-06-18T11:15:35Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:22:41Z","remediation":"该漏洞影响 Linux 内核 5.11 至 5.19.3 版本中 MPTCP 子流在 eBPF 阻断场景下的内存泄漏问题。建议将内核升级至 5.19.4 及以上版本，合入 commit c0bf3c6aa444（主线）或 6139039c8fc5（稳定树）中的补丁。若无法立即升级，可禁用 MPTCP 模块（modprobe -r mptcp 并添加 blacklist mptcp）作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/6139039c8fc5c9dbcdc3ad389b9a6d0cacb4d693","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c0bf3c6aa444a5ef44acc57ef6cfa53fd4fc1c9b","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2022/50xxx/CVE-2022-50071.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-50071.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-50071","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2022-50071.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/99462b1672511a2817705398570cd388f155e617/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-50071.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/36ddac9224d3973c64320c39be98ecc1f1ca5395/advisories/unreviewed/2025/06/GHSA-vrj8-wvhm-6q8h/GHSA-vrj8-wvhm-6q8h.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2022-50071.html","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/first/CVE-2022-50071","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/f446e11135d45cb1643208c82d3c441bd9ae1832/osv/AZL-70352.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/f512a6380c0fd7280df4c2cf20ec9cd829dae142/2022/CVE-2022-50071.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0088.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0087","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0087.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-50070","title":"Linux Kernel MPTCP 子流关闭时数据排队不当导致拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 MPTCP（多路径 TCP）协议实现存在条件竞争漏洞，当 MPTCP 子流关闭过程中，数据包调度器在获取子流套接字锁之前检查子流状态，导致可能在已关闭的子流上排队或重传数据，触发空指针解引用或释放后重用，可造成内核崩溃导致拒绝服务。本地攻击者可通过构造特定网络请求触发该条件竞争。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核主线版本，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。Linux 内核社区已通过增加子流状态检查及后备 TCP 回退场景检查完成修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2022-50070"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-06-18T11:15:35Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:22:41Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Linux 内核至 v6.0 及以上版本，或升级至包含提交 c886d70286bf 反向移植的 5.19.x 稳定版本（如 5.19.2+）。对于无法立即升级内核的系统，可通过编译内核时禁用 CONFIG_MPTCP（设置为 n）来完全规避该漏洞；若必须使用 MPTCP，则需手动 cherry-pick 提交 c886d70286bf 并重新编译内核。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/8caf5c15b5288d52d9c89374d6c10fa32ee84ec5","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c886d70286bf3ad411eb3d689328a67f7102c6ae","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/fb9c73ef2ac2ec816efdc8b9267bc04e1369c20b","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2022/50xxx/CVE-2022-50070.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-50070.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-50070","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2022-50070.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/09ea4c6e198f67c97f9e843f2fc9dbea00a9ec98/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-50070.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/36ddac9224d3973c64320c39be98ecc1f1ca5395/advisories/unreviewed/2025/06/GHSA-q5qw-2m53-6mfq/GHSA-q5qw-2m53-6mfq.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2022-50070.html","https://github.com/ctrliq/advisories/blob/b05bfbc3a1de170377430c48777435c2cc639f64/csaf/vex/cve/2022/cve-2022-50070.json","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/first/CVE-2022-50070","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/f446e11135d45cb1643208c82d3c441bd9ae1832/osv/AZL-70349.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0087.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0086","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0086.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-50016","title":"Linux kernel ASoC SOF Intel Cannonlake 空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 ASoC SOF 子系统中 Intel CNL 驱动存在空指针解引用漏洞。在固件启动完成（FW_READY）之前，若损坏的固件提前发送 IPC 回复消息，由于 reply_data 内存仅在收到 FW_READY 后才分配，未过滤的提前回复将导致空指针解引用，造成内核崩溃。该漏洞同时影响 IPC3 与 IPC4 固件，本地低权限攻击者可利用此漏洞发起拒绝服务攻击，影响 Linux 内核全版本。CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-50016"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-06-18T11:15:29Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:22:34Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 5.19.4 及以上版本（或合入补丁 commit 230f646085d1 / acacd9eefd0d），在 sound/soc/sof/intel/cnl.c 中增加对固件启动状态的检查，过滤掉固件启动完成前（FW_READY 前）的 IPC 回复消息，避免空指针解引用。如无法立即升级，可在系统启动参数中添加 snd-sof-intel-hda-common.disable=1 临时禁用 SOF 音频驱动作为缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/230f646085d17a008b609eb8fe8befb8811868f0","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/acacd9eefd0def5a83244d88e5483b5f38ee7287","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2022/50xxx/CVE-2022-50016.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-50016.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-50016","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2022-50016.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/09ea4c6e198f67c97f9e843f2fc9dbea00a9ec98/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-50016.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/36ddac9224d3973c64320c39be98ecc1f1ca5395/advisories/unreviewed/2025/06/GHSA-wc54-j9wv-p9v7/GHSA-wc54-j9wv-p9v7.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2022-50016.html","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/first/CVE-2022-50016","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7147309bae29310ee5f10d9376d209c24b3c5369/2022/CVE-2022-50016.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/27dcc23268ea595c1e22ac2008b340bb4e848cb2/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2022-50016"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0086.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0084","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0084.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-50009","title":"Linux f2fs 空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 F2FS 文件系统驱动在实现原子写入功能时存在空指针解引用漏洞。提交 3db1de0e582c 更改了原子写入方式，为原子写入文件创建了 COW（写时复制）inode，但在 f2fs_do_write_data_page 写入该 COW inode 时错误地访问了其自身为空的 COW inode 指针，导致空指针解引用。本地攻击者可通过触发原子写入操作引发内核崩溃，造成拒绝服务（DoS）。该漏洞影响 Linux 5.19-rc6 及之前版本的内核。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-50009"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-06-18T11:15:28Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:22:33Z","remediation":"立即将 Linux 内核升级至 5.18.18 或 5.19.4 及以上版本（包含对应稳定版修复）。各发行版用户请安装对应安全更新：如 Ubuntu 安装 linux-image-5.19.0-* 更新，RHEL/CentOS 更新 kernel 包至修复版本。如暂时无法重启升级，可禁用 f2fs 文件系统的原子写入功能（通过 mount 选项 `noatomic_write`），或避免在不可信来源的 f2fs 分区上执行写操作以降低触发风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/0f63e33eca6fa29a11c76fa31db5fe1cada5ad6e","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/4a2c5b7994960fac29cf8a3f4e62855bae1b27d4","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/7000ad53ec1b17bd2fac76984b7b0c663755cbb7","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2022/50xxx/CVE-2022-50009.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-50009.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-50009","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2022-50009.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/09ea4c6e198f67c97f9e843f2fc9dbea00a9ec98/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-50009.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/36ddac9224d3973c64320c39be98ecc1f1ca5395/advisories/unreviewed/2025/06/GHSA-5rcp-34mv-5hf3/GHSA-5rcp-34mv-5hf3.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2022-50009.html","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/first/CVE-2022-50009","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7147309bae29310ee5f10d9376d209c24b3c5369/2022/CVE-2022-50009.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/27dcc23268ea595c1e22ac2008b340bb4e848cb2/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2022-50009"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0084.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0083","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0083.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-50002","title":"Linux kernel mlx5 网卡驱动 LAG 链路聚合空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 Mellanox mlx5 网卡驱动的链路聚合（LAG）模块存在逻辑缺陷漏洞，由于 MLX5_LAG_FLAG_NDEVS_READY 标志设置不当，当 PF0 和 PF1 加载顺序异常时可能导致空指针解引用。本地攻击者可通过触发特定的设备加载/卸载序列，使内核在调用 mlx5_lag_is_multipath() 时访问空指针，造成系统崩溃（拒绝服务）。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核 5.18 之前版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中危。社区已在内核主线提交补丁修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-50002"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-06-18T11:15:28Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:22:31Z","remediation":"建议升级 Linux 内核至 5.18 及以上版本，该漏洞已在 5.18-rc5 期间由 commit 修复。如无法升级内核，可应用对应稳定版内核的 backport 补丁（参考 kernel.org 稳定树），并避免在未完成双 PF 注册前热拔插 mlx5 网卡作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/4c040acf5744e87a7b3490f9ec8bedd0d15c9f29","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/a6e675a66175869b7d87c0e1dd0ddf93e04f8098","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2022/50xxx/CVE-2022-50002.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/09ea4c6e198f67c97f9e843f2fc9dbea00a9ec98/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-50002.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2022/CVE-2022-50002.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7147309bae29310ee5f10d9376d209c24b3c5369/2022/CVE-2022-50002.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2022-50002.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/9a46b24d95069d9cc19a8f0c90335571fe0fa610/tracker/CVE/2022/CVE-2022-50002.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-50002.yaml","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2022/50xxx/CVE-2022-50002.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-50002","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/692d388eb1f385f95176b354865e7a8f070426f8/CVE-2022/CVE-2022-500xx/CVE-2022-50002.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0083.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0082","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0082.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-49997","title":"Linux lantiq_xrx200 网络驱动内存分配失败后无效缓冲区引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 Lantiq xrx200 网络驱动中存在内存释放缺陷（CWE-401），当驱动在特定路径下发生内存分配失败时，系统会存储无效的缓冲区地址。后续重新使用该描述符时，内核会在 `build_skb()` 函数中访问已释放或无效的内存，导致系统崩溃（内核 panic）。该漏洞仅需本地低权限用户即可触发，影响使用 Lantiq xrx200 网卡驱动的嵌入式 Linux 设备，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。Linux 内核社区已通过补丁修复此问题，建议用户更新至包含该修复的内核版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-49997"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-06-18T11:15:27Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:19:42Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 5.19.6 或更高版本（6.0 及以上已修复），长期稳定分支可分别 cherry-pick 补丁提交 c9c3b1775f80 或 3ef2786e32d9。若无法立即升级内核，可临时禁用 lantiq_xrx200 以太网驱动模块（rmmod lantiq_xrx200），但注意该操作将禁用相关网口功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3ef2786e32d93e562cd40601248a14ae090de873","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c9c3b1775f80fa21f5bff874027d2ccb10f5d90c","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49997.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-49997.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-49997","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2022-49997.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/09ea4c6e198f67c97f9e843f2fc9dbea00a9ec98/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-49997.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/36ddac9224d3973c64320c39be98ecc1f1ca5395/advisories/unreviewed/2025/06/GHSA-5v59-j8mr-j2wp/GHSA-5v59-j8mr-j2wp.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2022-49997.html","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/first/CVE-2022-49997","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2022/CVE-2022-49997.json","https://github.com/x-s-g/Vuln-Intro/blob/aa42031a1aaff880d1d582777ef18a1a29cbebc3/Vuln-Intro/Data_Crawling/nvd/linux_kernel_cve_ids.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0082.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0081","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0081.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-49980","title":"Linux 内核 USB Gadget 释放后使用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 USB Gadget 子系统的 usb_udc_uevent() 函数中存在释放后使用（Use-After-Free）漏洞。该漏洞源于 uevent 回调处理与 gadget 驱动注销之间存在竞态条件：usb_udc_uevent() 在访问 udc->driver 指针时未持有 udc_lock 互斥锁，若 gadget 驱动被同时卸载，已释放的驱动结构体可能被继续访问，触发 KASAN 检测到的释放后读错误。本地攻击者可通过精心构造的 USB 设备热插拔操作触发此竞态条件，导致系统崩溃或潜在权限提升。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核 5.19-rc4 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。Linux 内核社区已通过添加互斥锁修复此问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2022-49980"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-06-18T11:15:25Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:19:40Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 5.19-rc5 及以上版本，或合入提交 `https://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/torvalds/linux.git/commit/?id=bfe6c2f6f1c6a955f04f7ad0b22d2c7c3b5e9e38`。如无法立即升级，可禁用 USB Gadget 相关模块（如 `modprobe -r usb_f_* g_*`）或限制物理 USB 设备接入以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2191c00855b03aa59c20e698be713d952d51fc18","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f44b0b95d50fffeca036e1ba36770390e0b519dd","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49980.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-49980.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-49980","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2022-49980.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/09ea4c6e198f67c97f9e843f2fc9dbea00a9ec98/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-49980.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/36ddac9224d3973c64320c39be98ecc1f1ca5395/advisories/unreviewed/2025/06/GHSA-w97r-pxm9-vm23/GHSA-w97r-pxm9-vm23.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2022-49980.html","https://github.com/GingaShift/Anssi-Vulnerability-Intelligence/blob/5e1cffb341ca5a500e965d4cda39bf8603e2ff16/data/offline_prof/first/CVE-2022-49980","https://github.com/sfX-android/automation_scripts/blob/31ea3918bf444b85e03796e19b5377a53835812b/roles/axp/common/templates/cve_excludes/common.j2","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/f446e11135d45cb1643208c82d3c441bd9ae1832/osv/AZL-70220.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0081.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0080","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0080.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-49967","title":"Linux Kernel BPF 数据竞争漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 BPF 子系统中的 bpf_jit_limit 变量存在数据竞争漏洞，由于在读操作时未使用 READ_ONCE() 宏进行同步，并发写操作（通过 sysctl 接口调用 WRITE_ONCE()）可能导致读取到撕裂数据（load-tearing）。本地攻击者可通过低权限访问触发该条件竞争，造成内核信息泄露或系统拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核版本，CVSS 评分 4.7，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.7,"aliases":["CVE-2022-49967"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-06-18T11:15:24Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:19:38Z","remediation":"立即升级 Linux 内核至 5.19.8 或更高版本（含 6.x LTS 系列），或合入补丁提交 ba632ad0bacb / 0947ae112108。该 commit 在读取 bpf_jit_limit 时添加 READ_ONCE() 配对宏以消除加载撕裂的竞态条件。若无法升级，可通过设置 sysctl kernel.unprivileged_bpf_disabled=1 禁止非特权 BPF 程序加载，或通过内核参数 bpf_jit_enable=0 关闭 BPF JIT 编译作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/0947ae1121083d363d522ff7518ee72b55bd8d29","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ba632ad0bacb13197a8f38e7526448974e87f292","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49967.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-49967.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-49967","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2022-49967.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/09ea4c6e198f67c97f9e843f2fc9dbea00a9ec98/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-49967.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/36ddac9224d3973c64320c39be98ecc1f1ca5395/advisories/unreviewed/2025/06/GHSA-f2f7-qfwq-94j2/GHSA-f2f7-qfwq-94j2.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2022-49967.html","https://github.com/GingaShift/Anssi-Vulnerability-Intelligence/blob/5e1cffb341ca5a500e965d4cda39bf8603e2ff16/data/offline_prof/first/CVE-2022-49967","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/47e2f0c893cc1d42b8b28fc31914dda6c9fad125/2022/CVE-2022-49967.json","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/first/CVE-2022-49967"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0080.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0079","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0079.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-49961","title":"Linux Kernel BPF 越界读取漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 BPF 验证器在处理 ARG_CONST_ALLOC_SIZE_OR_ZERO 类型参数时，未正确传播精度标记（precision markers），导致验证器在状态等价检查（states_equal）中错误地将不同标量视为等价，从而绕过内存边界检查。具有 CAP_BPF 权限的攻击者可通过加载特制 BPF 程序触发越界内存访问（CWE-125），可能导致信息泄露或权限提升。该漏洞影响未应用修复的 Linux 内核版本，CVSS 评分 7.1，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.1,"aliases":["CVE-2022-49961"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-06-18T11:15:23Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:19:37Z","remediation":"立即将 Linux 内核升级至 5.15.209、5.19.8 或 6.0 及以上版本。对应稳定分支已包含修复补丁（commit 2459615a8d7f、2fc31465c537、987b4c465ba2）。如无法立即升级内核，可限制 CAP_BPF 权限仅授予受信任进程，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2459615a8d7f44ac81f0965bc094e55ccb254717","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2fc31465c5373b5ca4edf2e5238558cb62902311","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/987b4c465ba28c662ca857be6c20fd2d96bc55f0","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49961.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-49961.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-49961","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2022-49961.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/09ea4c6e198f67c97f9e843f2fc9dbea00a9ec98/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-49961.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/36ddac9224d3973c64320c39be98ecc1f1ca5395/advisories/unreviewed/2025/06/GHSA-34r5-4vr6-q5h6/GHSA-34r5-4vr6-q5h6.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2022-49961.html","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/first/CVE-2022-49961","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/935010a28fdab6bbd2dc347ebc953db9773080d4/usn/8576-1.json","https://github.com/eunomia-bpf/bpf-benchmark/blob/d8f1d5f2a21ca20cc704e8e37bcdbeee41a8cb55/docs/tmp/20260326/bpf_live_patching_research_20260326.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0079.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0078","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0078.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-49955","title":"Linux Kernel powerpc/rtas 空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux kernel 的 powerpc/rtas 子系统中存在空指针解引用漏洞。当 IBM Cell 架构的 Linux 系统调用 RTAS 固件时，MSR[HV]（机器状态寄存器的 Hypervisor 位）未正确传递，导致内核错误地将固件地址空间视为用户空间，触发指令访问异常和内核崩溃（Oops）。攻击者可利用此漏洞在本地造成拒绝服务（系统崩溃）。CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。修复方式为在进入 RTAS 前正确复制当前 MSR 的 HV 位值。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-49955"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-06-18T11:15:22Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:19:37Z","remediation":"将 Linux 内核升级至 5.19.8 及以上版本，或主线 6.0 及以上版本；对于 5.15/5.17/5.18 稳定分支，分别应用补丁提交 8b08d4f97233（5.15/5.17）或 91926d8b7e71（5.18）。该漏洞仅影响 IBM Cell 平台，非 Cell 平台不受影响，无需额外缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/8b08d4f97233d8e58fff2fd9d5f86397a49733c5","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/91926d8b7e71aaf5f84f0cf208fc5a8b7a761050","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49955.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-49955.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-49955","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2022-49955.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/09ea4c6e198f67c97f9e843f2fc9dbea00a9ec98/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-49955.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/36ddac9224d3973c64320c39be98ecc1f1ca5395/advisories/unreviewed/2025/06/GHSA-q32g-q8h6-hf4v/GHSA-q32g-q8h6-hf4v.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2022-49955.html","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/first/CVE-2022-49955","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/71aa542df049a213b58bca03ae475180caa8877a/2022/CVE-2022-49955.json","https://github.com/x-s-g/Vuln-Intro/blob/aa42031a1aaff880d1d582777ef18a1a29cbebc3/Vuln-Intro/Data_Crawling/nvd/linux_kernel_cve_ids.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0078.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0077","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0077.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-49935","title":"Linux kernel dma-buf/dma-resv 释放后使用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 dma-buf/dma-resv 子系统存在释放后使用漏洞，当通过显式导出/导入 UAPI 向 dma_resv 对象添加栅栏(fence)时，内核错误地假设新栅栏一定比所有现有栅栏更新，未经此检查导致攻击者可强制内核触发释放后使用错误。本地攻击者可利用此漏洞实现权限提升或系统崩溃，影响使用该内核组件的 Linux 发行版，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2022-49935"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-06-18T11:15:20Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:19:34Z","remediation":"立即升级 Linux 内核至 5.19.8 及以上版本，或 6.0 及以上正式版本。如无法升级整个内核，可单独向后移植补丁 commit a3f7c10a269d5b77dd5822ade822643ced3057f0（稳定版后移植 ID：c4c798fe98adceb642050819cb57cbc8f5c27870），该补丁在 dma_resv 添加新 fence 时增加了时间顺序校验，防止用户态通过显式导出/导入接口触发释放后使用（Use-After-Free）。亦可限制非授权用户对 /dev/dma-heap 等 DMA-BUF 设备的访问作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/a3f7c10a269d5b77dd5822ade822643ced3057f0","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c4c798fe98adceb642050819cb57cbc8f5c27870","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49935.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-49935.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-49935","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2022-49935.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/09ea4c6e198f67c97f9e843f2fc9dbea00a9ec98/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-49935.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/36ddac9224d3973c64320c39be98ecc1f1ca5395/advisories/unreviewed/2025/06/GHSA-rj36-vf3r-744c/GHSA-rj36-vf3r-744c.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2022-49935.html","https://github.com/GingaShift/Anssi-Vulnerability-Intelligence/blob/5e1cffb341ca5a500e965d4cda39bf8603e2ff16/data/offline_prof/first/CVE-2022-49935","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/f446e11135d45cb1643208c82d3c441bd9ae1832/osv/AZL-70208.json","https://github.com/fderuiter/lambda-wave/blob/352d151151b3004e320d909f59dc8b1fa30f2838/.trivyignore"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0077.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0085","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0085.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-50015","title":"Linux kernel ASoC SOF Intel HDA-IPC 空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Intel SOF（Sound Open Firmware）音频驱动中 HDA-IPC 模块存在逻辑缺陷，在固件完成启动前处理 IPC 回复可能导致未初始化内存访问或状态不一致。本地攻击者可利用此竞争条件引发系统崩溃或内核信息泄露，影响搭载 Intel HDA 音频控制器的 Linux 系统。厂商已在内核主线中合入修复补丁。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-50015"],"sources":["kernel","nvd"],"published":"2025-06-18T00:00:00Z","updated":"2025-06-18T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 5.19.4 或更高版本，或合入内核主线修复补丁 48945246cf80 / 499cc881b09c，在固件启动前过滤 IPC 回复，避免空指针解引用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/48945246cf802b9866f3a821103f1a7a196baf68","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/499cc881b09c8283ab5e75b0d6d21cb427722161"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0085.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0076","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0076.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-49932","title":"Linux Kernel KVM VMX 空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux KVM 虚拟化子系统的 VMX 模块存在初始化顺序缺陷，在完成所有必要初始化之前便将 /dev/kvm 暴露给用户空间。本地具有 /dev/kvm 访问权限的攻击者可在初始化未完成时通过 ioctl 系统调用创建虚拟机，触发 per-CPU loaded_vmcss_on_cpu 链表的空指针解引用，导致内核崩溃引发拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-49932"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-05-02T16:15:22Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:19:34Z","remediation":"更新 Linux 内核至 6.0 及以上版本，或合入官方修复补丁（commit: kvm_init() 后移至所有 VMX 初始化完成之后）。如无法升级内核，可临时卸载 kvm_intel 模块（modprobe -r kvm_intel）并禁止自动加载，禁用 KVM 虚拟化功能作为缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e136e969d268b9b89329c816c002e53f60e82985","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e28533c08023c4b319b7f2cd77f3f7c9204eb517","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e32b120071ea114efc0b4ddd439547750b85f618","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49932.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-49932.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-49932","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2022-49932.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/09ea4c6e198f67c97f9e843f2fc9dbea00a9ec98/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-49932.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/36ddac9224d3973c64320c39be98ecc1f1ca5395/advisories/unreviewed/2025/05/GHSA-gfj7-8hq4-g63x/GHSA-gfj7-8hq4-g63x.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2022-49932.html","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/first/CVE-2022-49932","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--4c96d113-2f8b-431d-88df-2a1bf8703cd9.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/71aa542df049a213b58bca03ae475180caa8877a/2022/CVE-2022-49932.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo